<title>USA: GTS to buy waste processor from Westinghouse.</title>
<headline>GTS to buy waste processor from Westinghouse.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTS Duratek Inc said Thursday it had signed a definitive agreement to acquire Scientific Ecology Group Inc from Westinghouse Electric Corp for $28 million in cash and 156,986 GTS shares.</p>
<p>Scientific Ecology, a commerical radioactive waste processor, had sales of $105 million in 1996.</p>
<p>GTS said it expects to close the transction this month.</p>
<p>GTS shares were off 1/8 at eight.</p>
</text>
